diff --git a/docs/en/api/system.md b/docs/en/api/system.md
index 19c40efd3..0c282c1ac 100644
--- a/docs/en/api/system.md
+++ b/docs/en/api/system.md
@@ -51,0 +52,5 @@ pre-dispatch and argument preparation on the waiting core remain available.
+For a verified unconditional Set, the compiler also prearms the completion
+kind through submission metadata. Normal execution does not write that GM
+marker; a cancelled Wait clears it before returning without tail events.
+The runtime can skip the control-line clear/writeback only when it was not
+modified by prefix handoff or diagnostic instrumentation.
diff --git a/docs/zh/api/system.md b/docs/zh/api/system.md
